== [    BASIC ] ============================================================================================
   MNEMONIC: wrussq [ENC: EVEX, MAP: MAP4, OPC: 0x65]
     LENGTH:  7
        SSZ: 64
       EOSZ: 64
       EASZ: 64
   CATEGORY: CET
    ISA-SET: APX_F_CET
    ISA-EXT: APXEVEX
 EXCEPTIONS: APX_EVEX_CET_WRUSS
 ATTRIBUTES: HAS_MODRM HAS_SIB HAS_EVEX IS_PRIVILEGED ACCEPTS_SEGMENT HAS_EEVEX 
  OPTIMIZED: 62 6C F9 08 65 04 F8 

