##       TYPE  VISIBILITY  ACTION      ENCODING   SIZE  NELEM  ELEMSZ  ELEMTYPE                        VALUE
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------
 0     MEMORY    EXPLICIT       W      MODRM_RM     64      1      64      UINT  TYPE  =                 MEM
                                                                                 SEG   =                  ds
                                                                                 BASE  =                 r16
                                                                                 INDEX =                 r23
                                                                                 SCALE =                   8
                                                                                 DISP  =  0x0000000000000000
 1   REGISTER    EXPLICIT       R     MODRM_REG     64      1      64      UINT                          r24
