== [      APX ] ============================================================================================
  USES_EGPR: Y
     HAS_NF: N
     HAS_ZU: N
        SCC: NONE

== [      ATT ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: wrussq %r24, (%r16,%r23,8)
   RELATIVE: wrussq %r24, (%r16,%r23,8)

== [    INTEL ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: wrussq qword ptr ds:[r16+r23*8], r24
   RELATIVE: wrussq qword ptr ds:[r16+r23*8], r24

